        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs work whose items add further items, with at most workerCount threads. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The first items start the work. Each call of function may add items through addItem. A worker starts a further worker when items are waiting and a worker index is free. Each workerIndex is used by one thread at a time, so a caller keeps one slot per worker and needs no lock.</para>
<para>The failures are held in one slot per worker. Each worker writes only its own slot, and the array never resizes, so no lock is needed. A failed item is caught. Its worker keeps the last failure in its slot and takes the next item. After all workers join, the failure of the lowest-numbered failed worker is thrown again in the calling thread.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Item</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of one work item. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Function</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Callable accepting <computeroutput>(int workerIndex, Item item, addItem)</computeroutput>, where addItem takes an Item and adds it to the work. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>workerCount</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The maximum number of threads. Must be positive. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>firstItems</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The items that start the work. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>function</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Callable invoked from worker threads for each item. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
