    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs indexed work and dynamically generated work across a bounded set of threads. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Work is claimed through atomic counters, so the scheduling path holds no lock. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
